=== 4. THE CACHE-BUSTER (exafyltd/vitana-v1, separate PR) ===

The gateway serves the widget `immutable, max-age=31536000` ON PURPOSE; the
?v= query parameter in vitana-v1/index.html IS the cache-busting mechanism.
Without bumping it this fix would never be fetched by any device that has
already loaded the widget — including the reporting iPhone. Both the preload
and the script tag bumped to the identical value (a drift between them makes
the browser fetch the file twice; VTID-04099 pins that with a test).

