=== 6. ROUTE-MOUNT PROOF ===

See outputs/curl-route-before-deploy.txt — captured live against staging
BEFORE this merges: the new path returns 404 text/html (route absent on the
deployed code, per §15's own diagnostic), while its already-live sibling on
the same router prefix returns 200 application/json. That control rules out
a bad prefix or an unreachable host.

Note the sibling's live response: {"ok":false,"reason":"anonymous_no_ack"} —
a real, live demonstration of exactly the behaviour the new route must NOT
copy, since the reported failure is pre-login.

